WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.053
Choose precise sensory details and a clear order so a reader can picture a person,

00:00:05.053 --> 00:00:06.024
place or event.

00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:11.760
When reporting a school event, which detail gives time? Answer: Friday morning at

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:12.136
nine.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:17.195
Describe a Ghanaian market in a paragraph using sound, colour and movement.

00:00:18.033 --> 00:00:21.020
Why it works: A stated time locates the event.
